Use alloc, core, io, map, string.

Let table be StrMap of whole number.
Let alpha be create text from "alpha3" of length 6.
Let beta be create text from "beta3" of length 5.
Put 3 into text map address of table for text address of alpha.
Put 4 into text map address of table for text address of beta.
Let found be look up text address of alpha in text map address of table.
If found.has_value, say 1, otherwise say 0.
Say found.value.
Let removed be strmap_remove(address of table, address of beta).
Say removed.
Free text map address of table.
Release text address of alpha.
Release text address of beta.
Let used be bytes in use.
If used is not 0.
Stop with error "strmap leak".
End the condition.
Give back 0.
